# What the picnic baskets on the road hold. `odds` give the chance of each item by place in
# the race, first place first: the leaders get slicks to drop, the last get peppers.

item pomodorata
    name Pomodorata
    text A ripe tomato, thrown forward. Whoever it hits drives on with sauce all over the windscreen.
    kind throw
    model tomato.glb
    speed 34
    life 2.5
    radius 1.9
    effect splat 2.6
    power 0.72
    odds 3 3 2 2
end

item olio
    name Olive-oil slick
    text A bottle of the good oil, emptied behind you. Karts that drive into it spin round.
    kind drop
    model bottle-oil.glb
    life 30
    hits 2
    radius 1.9
    effect spin 1.1
    odds 4 3 2 1
end

item peperoncino
    name Peperoncino
    text A hot chilli: a burst of speed.
    kind boost
    model paprika.glb
    effect boost 1.7
    power 1.38
    odds 1 2 3 4
end

item parmigiano
    name Parmesan wheel
    text A whole wheel of Parmigiano, rolled ahead along the road. It knocks aside whoever it meets.
    kind roll
    model wheel:e8c468
    speed 45
    life 9
    radius 2.1
    effect bump 1
    odds 1 2 3 3
end

item sushi
    name Sushi roll
    text It takes aim at the racer ahead, then rolls off in a straight line.
    kind aim
    model maki-salmon.glb
    aim 0.7
    speed 42
    life 4
    radius 1.8
    effect bump 0.8
    odds 2 2 2 2
end
